    {
      "id": "6ae388525fa9f64db6d1d947",
      "name": "Prediction Markets Emerge as a New Vertical for Traffer Teams",
      "description": "Multiple Russian-language traffer teams have rapidly adapted affiliate-fraud models to exploit growing interest in prediction markets like PolyMarket and Kalshi since spring 2026. Three teams—AtlasCore, PolyFucked, and Magnetic Team—provide comprehensive fraud infrastructure including websites, administrative panels, cryptocurrency payment systems, and technical support. These services enable affiliates to deploy convincing prediction-market interfaces combined with established fraud mechanisms such as controlled trading outcomes, fabricated market activity, artificial withdrawal restrictions, and collection of sensitive identity information. Artificial intelligence accelerates these operations by reducing time and expertise required for platform development, content creation, social engineering, and victim engagement. The rapid adoption demonstrates how mature fraud ecosystems can pivot toward emerging technologies and financial products without developing entirely new criminal capabilities. Prediction ma...",
      "author_name": "AlienVault",
      "modified": "2026-10-30T08:22:10.083000",
      "created": "2026-10-29T17:54:26.560000",
      "revision": 2,
