    {
      "id": "6ae244fe073f118d830cf4be",
      "name": "Adversary Unmasked APT Profile - Star Blizzard",
      "description": "Star Blizzard, attributed to the Russian Federal Security Service Centre 18, is a persistent espionage group targeting government officials, defence personnel, think tanks, NGOs, and academia primarily in the UK, US, Ukraine, and NATO countries. The group conducts credential theft and hack-and-leak operations through sophisticated spear-phishing, impersonation, and relationship building. Since 2024, operations expanded from credential harvesting to deploying endpoint malware including SPICA, YESROBOT, MAYBEROBOT, and CosmicPulse backdoors. Notable shifts include moving from targeted to bulk phishing campaigns, incorporating fake CAPTCHA lures, exploiting iOS devices with leaked DarkSword exploit kit, and using compromised WordPress sites as infrastructure. The group rapidly adapts tooling after exposure, with new malware variants appearing within days of public disclosure. Recent campaigns targeted over 100 organizations using the RedFlick delivery chain, demonstrating increased scale and sophistication.",
      "author_name": "AlienVault",
      "modified": "2026-10-29T14:24:10.022000",
      "created": "2026-10-28T18:54:54.255000",
      "revision": 2,
