    {
      "id": "6ab2691621023818faaf620e",
      "name": "Open Season on Kapibala: Attacker Steals Over 18,000 Government Records Through WordPress Exploitation",
      "description": "A suspected Chinese-speaking threat actor, operating from UTC+8 timezone and linked to Red Heron, conducted extensive exploitation campaigns from May through September 2026. The adversary maintained persistent use of a single IP address to target multiple technologies including WordPress, ZyXEL switches, and various enterprise platforms. In the most severe incident, the attacker exploited WordPress vulnerabilities CVE-2026-63030 and CVE-2026-60137 to breach a western government organization, stealing over 18,000 sensitive records containing credentials and personally identifiable information. Additionally, the actor exploited CVE-2026-7273 in ZyXEL GS1900 switches, compromising 996 devices across 48 countries and exfiltrating configurations and credentials. The attacker demonstrated sophisticated capabilities including custom tool development possibly leveraging large language models, privilege escalation attempts, and systematic data exfiltration using PowerShell-based collection and staging techniques.",
      "author_name": "AlienVault",
      "modified": "2026-10-23T12:03:11.817000",
      "created": "2026-09-22T11:40:06.751000",
      "revision": 2,
      "tlp": "white",
