    {
      "id": "6ad1cb3feb7d313786acfcf5",
      "name": "ARMORY CASTLE Exploits BeyondTrust",
      "description": "On October 15, BeyondTrust disclosed CVE-2026-102764, a vulnerability affecting BeyondTrust Remote Support appliances that enables arbitrary file upload. Mandiant identified ARMORY CASTLE, a suspected PRC-nexus espionage actor, exploiting this as a zero-day in late August 2026. Following exploitation, the actor deployed SAWFLY webshell and BARECLAW tunneler, escalated privileges using SUID bit manipulation, harvested credentials from the BeyondTrust vault, and established persistent access by modifying sudoers templates and HAProxy configurations. The actor demonstrated deep knowledge of BeyondTrust internals, abusing proprietary CLI utilities and reverse-proxy routing. They systematically deleted logs to evade detection and leveraged compromised administrator credentials to pivot laterally and exfiltrate sensitive documents. Organizations face potential widespread exploitation as ARMORY CASTLE historically conducts opportunistic campaigns following vulnerability disclosure. Immediate patching and comprehe...",
      "author_name": "AlienVault",
      "modified": "2026-10-16T07:18:40.335000",
      "created": "2026-10-16T06:59:11.245000",
      "revision": 2,
      "tlp": "white",
      "public": 1,
      "adversary": "ARMORY CASTLE",
      "indicators": [
        {
          "id": 3821939010,
